#43004
centaur warden corrin~
Corrin, the centaur warden~
Corrin, the centaur warden, watches over the valley, a spear at his side.
~
Corrin is a centaur, his upper body that of a broad-shouldered man with
a short gray beard, his lower body that of a chestnut horse gone gray
about the muzzle.  He carries an ash spear and wears a cloak of green
wool pinned with a silver thread-and-spindle brooch.  He has guarded the
valley since before most kingdoms had names, and he has seen a great
many people come here hoping to change their fate.
~
