spinner fate young woman~
the Spinner~
A young woman with bright eyes sits at a spinning wheel, spinning mist into thread.
~
She is young and lovely, with flowers in her hair and a quick, warm
smile, and her fingers never stop moving as she draws the mist down out
of the air and spins it into shining thread.  Every so often a new
thread leaves her spindle and floats away among the trees.  She is the
first of the Fates, who begins every life.
~
