#43009
measurer fate woman~
the Measurer~
A stern woman in gray measures a long thread against a rod of polished wood.
~
She is a woman in her middle years, plainly dressed in gray, with gray
eyes and ink-stained fingers.  She lays thread after thread along her
measuring rod, ties a tiny knot to mark its length, and sets it aside
without a word.  She is the second of the Fates, who decides how long
each life shall be.
~
