cutter fate old crone~
the Cutter~
A bent old woman sits beside a stump, a pair of great iron shears in her lap.
~
She is ancient beyond guessing, bent and white-haired, her face as
creased as a walnut, and her eyes are the clear, pale gray of a winter
sky.  The great iron shears in her lap are worn bright along their
blades.  She is the last of the Fates, who ends every life, and she does
not seem in the least unkind.
~
