#43012
treeherd zxyer ancient tree~
an ancient Zxyer treeherd~
One of the Zxyer trees here has a face, and it is watching you.
~
What you took for a Zxyer tree is something more: a towering tree-herd,
its bark silver-green and ridged with age, its eyes deep knots that glow
a soft amber.  It moves only when it wishes to, and then with a slow,
terrible strength.  It tends the trees of the valley, and it does not
take kindly to anyone who harms them.
~
